    Bug 1910483 - Make the used IMAP extensions in browser tests configurable and wait for folder event when creating messages. r=mkmelin

    This follow-up allows browser tests to define which IMAP extensions they
    want to enable, instead of hardcoding it.

    We also now wait for a folder update when creating messages (seen this
    in other mail tests while investigating intermittent fails).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D241147

